{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving down a dark road, heading to a Halloween party your friends have organized at a remote farm. What seemed like a night of fun, music, and beer soon turns into a blood-stained hell. The farm has a legend stained with despair... and someone is watching you from the shadows. The Scarlet Harvest is a horror and survival game inspired by classic 90s slasher movies. Explore iconic horror settings: lonely gas stations, eerie cornfields, dark barns, and a cursed farm that hides more than one secret. If you like horror games with action, constant tension, and an immersive atmosphere, here you will enjoy a unique experience that combines exploration, partying, and survival. Dance with your friends, throw firecrackers, talk to your friends... but be prepared to run, fight, and survive when the horror begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While you are enjoying the party, someone is watching you from afar...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, a ramshackle farm, sinister cornfields, dark barns... A horror story in the classic style of the 90's Slasher movies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.poster.avif?t=1767627620\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.webm?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.mp4?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and gloomy levels with a unique detail and care for details of @TonyDevGame,  (I love detailing the games friends!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.poster.avif?t=1767627620\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.webm?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.mp4?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored of walking simulators? No problem, here you will have to run for your life, and you will also be able to face your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.poster.avif?t=1767627620\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.webm?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.mp4?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a great time at the party with your buddies! Have a beer, dance a little, talk to your friends, throw a few firecrackers.... Enjoy before it's too late!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.poster.avif?t=1767627620\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.webm?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.mp4?t=1767627620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game has an autosave system and some gore scenes.</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FORGETFUL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/46a62d5a94d0d7f3be10599eead4a44006e8de3e.jpg"},{"name":"ICE CUBE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/1cab27af1ec6fb773c469d63c60408aad08e2a4f.jpg"},{"name":"PARTY HARD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/8acc4617cc33e05f84521339c6b66e5a76f23547.jpg"},{"name":"I LOVE HALLOWEEN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/dfe8c009960d102f59b32e7a2bcc4d2dbd50bffb.jpg"},{"name":"THE GREEN MILE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/6295eaa2ac564448c40f0ef1cd0900f06ea8ae6c.jpg"},{"name":"WELCOME TO THE FAMILY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/94b9ce4625a658d6a6e4314636a95fb79786a110.jpg"},{"name":"BE QUICK OR BE DEAD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/2a4d90c7ae5ef27aa77cbd7404455950f2c20649.jpg"},{"name":"HOUSE OF THE DEAD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/35fc7c7f61025523c02cabd05535df39ffe9aeb7.jpg"},{"name"